From 8f83848269b0cd3e4204f6a1d63bb96c19f7edb5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: logdog2325 <loganjayfisher@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 10:45:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 44/44] Android: add PBR online mode + a hub to pick XD or PBR
 (XD launcher untouched)

PokemonHubActivity is the new app entry: pick XD or PBR. Each button opens that
mode's own launcher, which force-applies only that mode's config, so the two
never collide -- and the XD launcher's code is completely unchanged (it's just
opened from the hub now instead of being the home activity; only its manifest
intent-filter moved).

PBR mode (PbrLauncherActivity/Screen) targets the UPA private-server route:
import the UPA nand.bin (NAND + appended keys), register the pre-patched RPBE01
ISO, and boot -- no SSL certs, no DNS change, no activation wait. ensurePbrConfig
turns the emulated-GBA SI ports OFF (the XD launcher flips them back to 13 when
opened, so XD is unaffected) and enables cheats so RPBE01.ini's bundled on-frame
black-screen fix + EFB graphics fix apply. Adds MAIN_WIRELESS_MAC (no Android UI
exposed it) for a future Wiimmfi route.
